Source landscape note: I found a broad 2023 Ethiopia documentary universe around Abiy Ahmed that spans UN fact-finding, OHCHR, U.S. State Department, EHRC, FIDH/OMCT, HRW, Amnesty, CPJ, Reuters-syndicated reporting, and official Ethiopian government statements on the Amhara state of emergency, arrests, detention, and conflict-related abuse. I preserved both adverse and some exculpatory or justificatory sources, plus official/legal records and metadata-level candidates. I did not extract evidence claims or score anything.

